<title>USA: CollaGenex offers 1 million shares.</title>
<headline>CollaGenex offers 1 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN, Pa. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CollaGenex Pharmaceuticals Inc said Thursday it offered 1,000,000 shares of its common stock at a price of $12.50 each.</p>
<p>All of these shares were issued and sold by the company.</p>
</text>
